					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This&#8230; This is f*cking ART! Agent Ekblad and MTF Psi-7 are my favorite Foundation MTF now. It's nice seeing someone in the Foundation who truly loves what they do that isn't some horrible thing that makes them a horrible person.</p> <p>&quot;*Makes jazz hand motions* KABOOM!&quot;</p> <p>&quot;my best friend got taken out by a mutant fish squirrel last week&quot;</p> <p>ART!!</p> 
				 	]]>
